fted from premium genuine leather, this reversible belt is the ultimate blend of function and style. Designed for versatility, it features a smart rotating buckle that lets you switch seamlessly between two classic shades—perfect for both casual and formal outfits. Whether you're heading to the office or dressing up for an evening out, this belt adapts to your day with timeless sophistication. Durable, refined, and effortlessly stylish, it's a must-have accessory for the modern wardrobe.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e100% Genuine Leather\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual-tone reversible strap\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleek, rotating metal buckle\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHand-finished edges for lasting durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003e6 buckle holes \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003eReversible Use\u003c\/strong\u003e: Two looks in one belt,\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003ePremium Material\u003c\/strong\u003e: Made from split leather with Italian tech PU coating for enhanced texture, colour, and durability, ideal for formal and dress belts.\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003eHigh Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e: Water, scratch, and UV-resistant; colour-stable and rigorously quality-checked.\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003eRefined Hardware\u003c\/strong\u003e: Zamac buckle an alloy of zinc, aluminum, copper, and magnesium, for strength and a refined finish, built to last.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBuilt for: \u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFormal Pants | Smart Casual Pants | Special Occasions\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-11-13T01:10:02+05:30","created_at":"2025-07-23T21:52:20+05:30","vendor":"The Pant Project","type":"Readymade","tags":["addons","new arrivals","