/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gmail_default\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif;\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gmail_default\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKEY FEATURES:-\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gmail_default\"\u003e \u003cbr\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003e6 buckle holes \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003eReversible Use\u003c\/strong\u003e: Two looks in one belt,\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003ePremium Material\u003c\/strong\u003e: Made from split leather with Italian tech PU coating for enhanced texture, colour, and durability, ideal for formal and dress belts.\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003eHigh Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e: Water, scratch, and UV-resistant; colour-stable and rigorously quality-checked.\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003eRefined Hardware\u003c\/strong\u003e: Zamac buckle an alloy of zinc, aluminum, copper, and magnesium, for strength and a refined finish, built to last.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gmail_default\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBUILT FOR:- \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt for two-in-one versatility\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIdeal for office-to-evening transitions\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePerfect for minimal, travel-friendly packing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSuits both formal and casual outfits\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cstyle data-id=\"tinymce-storefront-style\"\u003e \n                    blockquote, iframe, .twitter-tweet{\n                        display: flex;\n                        margin-left: auto !important;\n                        margin-right: auto !important;\n                        max-width: 100%;\n                    }\n         