c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gmail_default\"\u003e \u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gmail_default\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003e6 buckle holes \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003eReversible Use\u003c\/strong\u003e: Two looks in one belt,\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003ePremium Material\u003c\/strong\u003e: Made from split leather with Italian tech PU coating for enhanced texture, colour, and durability, ideal for formal and dress belts.\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003eHigh Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e: Water, scratch, and UV-resistant; colour-stable and rigorously quality-checked.\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003eRefined Hardware\u003c\/strong\u003e: Zamac buckle an alloy of zinc, aluminum, copper, and magnesium, for strength and a refined finish, built to last.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBUILT FOR:- \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e• Built for two-in-one versatility \u003cbr\u003e• Ideal for office-to-evening transitions\u003cbr\u003e• Perfect for minimal, travel-friendly packing\u003cbr\u003e• Ideal for office-to-evening transitions\u003cbr\u003e• Suits both formal and casual outfits\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cstyle data-id=\"tinymce-storefront-style\"\u003e \n                    blockquote, iframe, .twitter-tweet{\n                        display: flex;\n                        margin-left: auto !important;\n                        margin-right: auto !important;\n                        max-width: 100%;\n                    }\n                    img{\n                        max-width: 100%;\n                        height: auto;\n                    }\n                    .warning-banner{\n                        visibility: hidden\n                    }\n                \u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e"}],"cart_enable_upsell":true,"product_handle_1":"premium-cotton-monogrammed-handkerchiefs","product_handle_2":"classic-leather-belt","product_handle_3":"the-dapper-socks-set","cart_coupon_enable":true,"cart_coupon_title":"Buy 4 Get 1 Free","cart_coupon_subtitle":"Enter code at checkout.","cart_coupon_code":"FREE5","faq_title":"Need Help ?","faq_one_title":"Which measurements will be used for my order?","faq_one_content":"\u003cp\u003eThe order from your latest order will be used. In case you had an alteration in your last order, don’t worry, we’ve stored your altered measurements and will use those measurements for your new order. \u003c\/p\u003e","faq_two_title":"My size has changed since my last order, can I give new measurements for my new order?","faq_two_content":"\u003cp\u003eYes, absolutely. You can place a new order using new measurements by simply using the “Add New Measurements” option. Your profile will also automatically get updated with these new measurements and will be available for all future orders.\u003c\/p\u003e","faq_three_title":"How can I check my last order measurements?","faq_three_content":"\u003cp\u003eYou can view the measurements that are in your profile by clicking on the “View More Details” button on any product page\u003c\/p\u003e","faq_four_title":"Can I update my measurements without placing an order?","faq_four_content":"\u003cp\u003eYes, you can. You can WhatsApp our customer service by clicking on the WhatsApp icon below and request them to update your profile. All updates will be done within 24 hours and will be available for you to use in the future.\u003c\/p\u003e","faq_five_title":"What if I don’t get the perfect fit even after using the latest measurements?","faq_five_content":"\u003cp\u003eDon’t worry, The Pant Project provides a “Fit Guarantee” so we will provide free alterations in order to ensure your new pants fit you perfectl