 11.4924C11.7803 11.4542 11.5923 11.3565 11.4443 11.2118C11.2963 11.0671 11.195 10.8819 11.1532 10.6798C11.1115 10.4777 11.1311 10.2678 11.2098 10.0768C11.2885 9.88588 11.4226 9.72249 11.5949 9.60749C11.7673 9.4925 11.9702 9.43107 12.1779 9.43105C12.3145 9.42882 12.4501 9.45364 12.577 9.50404C12.7038 9.55445 12.8193 9.62945 12.9166 9.72465C13.014 9.81986 13.0914 9.93338 13.1441 10.0586C13.1969 10.1838 13.2241 10.3182 13.2241 10.4539Z\" fill=\"#626262\"\u003e\u003c\/path\u003e\n\u003cpath d=\"M18.6747 14.1598H1.51377C1.23371 14.155 0.966945 14.0405 0.771361 13.8412C0.678893 13.7425 0.607331 13.6263 0.560951 13.4996C0.51457 13.3728 0.494312 13.2381 0.50137 13.1034C0.564792 11.8165 1.00829 10.5768 1.77655 9.53894C2.54481 8.50111 3.60378 7.71123 4.82112 7.26793C5.73925 6.93252 6.71157 6.76769 7.68967 6.78166H17.0379L16.0761 2.10321H5.7829C5.60389 2.10321 5.43222 2.03254 5.30564 1.90675C5.17906 1.78097 5.10795 1.61037 5.10795 1.43248C5.10795 1.25459 5.17906 1.08396 5.30564 0.958174C5.43222 0.832386 5.60389 0.761719 5.7829 0.761719H16.363C16.5949 0.761584 16.8196 0.841928 16.9983 0.988879C17.1769 1.13583 17.2984 1.34018 17.3416 1.56663L19.6702 12.9525C19.6988 13.0996 19.694 13.2513 19.656 13.3964C19.6181 13.5414 19.548 13.6762 19.4509 13.7909C19.3583 13.9071 19.2403 14.0008 19.1058 14.0647C18.9712 14.1286 18.8238 14.1612 18.6747 14.1598ZM1.885 12.8183H18.2528L17.3079 8.13991H7.68967C6.87376 8.11892 6.06112 8.24972 5.29359 8.52558C4.36939 8.83828 3.55588 9.40988 2.95111 10.1715C2.34635 10.9332 1.97609 11.8524 1.885 12.8183Z\" fill=\"#626262\"\u003e\u003c\/path\u003e\n\u003c\/svg\u003e","care_heading_4":"do not bleach","care_svg_4":"\u003csvg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" viewbox=\"0 0 23 17\" fill=\"none\"\u003e\n\u003cpath d=\"M17.9307 16.2813H5.02945C4.79 16.2831 4.5541 16.2239 4.34422 16.1093C4.13433 15.9947 3.95747 15.8286 3.83053 15.6269C3.71821 15.4207 3.65939 15.19 3.65939 14.9556C3.65939 14.7212 3.71821 14.4905 3.83053 14.2844L